OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council to fire and
OL,4,Arehire over 23,000 employees
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow City Council is to sack more
OL,7,Fthan 23,000 members of staff and then
OL,8,Frehire them to new contracts after pay
OL,9,Ftalks broke down with unions.
OL,11,FThe local authority says letters will
OL,12,Fbe sent to its non-teaching staff next
OL,13,Fweek, with new contracts then taking
OL,14,Feffect from 1 January.
OL,16,FTalks earlier this week between the
OL,17,Fcouncil and the GMB, Unison and Unite
OL,18,Funions fell apart on Wednesday when
OL,19,FUnison said it would not ballot its
OL,20,Fmembers on a proposed new pay offer.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
